{
 "schema": 1,
 "tier": "T0",
 "page": "ai/index.html",
 "id": "ai-same-hour",
 "fit": true,
 "model": "comparison-model",
 "by": "boundary",
 "default": "chat",
 "eyebrow": "The same hour, modeled 11/2026",
 "title": "An hour of chat and an hour of video overlap: about {now[chat][total]:.0f} and {now[video][total]:.0f} Wh, {fixed} Wh of each your own screen and router",
 "subtitle": "Energy for one hour, in watt-hours, one boundary at a time.",
 "text": [
  "The first question most readers bring is whether their own chat use is the problem, so the page starts there. It compares one hour of chat, video, and a short-video feed on the same phone, each segment labeled measured or modeled. Resolution #2026-039 set up this task force to identify what member Tribes hold in common on AI."
 ],
 "inputs": {
  "now": {
   "model": "computed_defaults.same_hour.default"
  },
  "lo": {
   "model": "computed_defaults.same_hour.low"
  },
  "hi": {
   "model": "computed_defaults.same_hour.high"
  },
  "prompt": {
   "model": "inputs.chat_wh_per_prompt.value"
  },
  "house": {
   "model": "inputs.household_wh_per_day.value"
  },
  "tv_wh": {
   "model": "inputs.device_wh_per_hour.tv"
  },
  "m": {
   "model": "inputs"
  },
  "a": {
   "model": "assumptions"
  },
  "want": {
   "model": "computed_defaults"
  },
  "k_r_low": {
   "claim": "fp-019",
   "field": "low"
  },
  "k_r_high": {
   "claim": "fp-019",
   "field": "high"
  },
  "k_h_low": {
   "claim": "fp-025",
   "field": "low"
  },
  "k_h_high": {
   "claim": "fp-025",
   "field": "high"
